    Conscience: "Look.  They're forcing you to use this machine.  Why do you think that is?"
    Ada: "I do not know.  I just assumed it was because they were <italic>lazy</>."
    Conscience: "No.  It's because they're cheating."
    Conscience: "They're using this machine to rig the game."
    +none()
    +panCameraToFitCharacters(700, false, ThugLeader)
    +:shakeZ(ThugLeader)
    ThugLeader: "Hey!  What are you muttering about over there?"
    +:jump(ThugLeader)
